en:
&lt;High Warlord Cromush's face turns white.&gt;

THEY HAVE FORSAKEN US? THEY HAVE FORSAKEN THE HORDE? This cannot be!

I...

&lt;Cromush falls to one knee.&gt;

I... I WILL BE FINE. We will do this without their aid. To hell with the Frostwolf!

&lt;Sylvanas takes the necklace from your grasp.&gt;

It can't be! After all this time, I thought it was lost forever.

&lt;After a lingering moment the Lady seems to become aware once again of her surroundings, composing herself.&gt;

You thought this would amuse me? Do you think I long for a time before I was the queen of the Forsaken? Like you, it means nothing to me, and Alleria Windrunner is a long dead memory!

&lt;She drops the amulet to the ground.&gt;

You may now remove yourself from my presence, &lt;class&gt;.

All those spiders. All those legs. 

&lt;Faerin shivers.&gt; 

I hope you fared well. Good work, &lt;name&gt;.

&lt;Sylvanas takes the necklace from your grasp.&gt;

It can't be! After all this time, I thought it was lost forever.

&lt;After a lingering moment the Lady seems to become aware once again of her surroundings, composing herself.&gt;

You thought this would amuse me? Do you think I long for a time before I was the queen of the Forsaken? Like you, it means nothing to me, and Alleria Windrunner is a long dead memory!

&lt;She drops the amulet to the ground.&gt;

You may now remove yourself from my presence, &lt;class&gt;.

I'm sure you are up to the task I have for you if you've made it this far in one piece.

&lt;Mayara Brightwing lowers her voice to a whisper.&gt;

Between you and me, you may want to enjoy yourself in the Grim Guzzler while you're there. It could be the last drink you ever have.

Heya, pal, mind if I take a look at that list?

&lt;Razzeric nearly spits!&gt;

What's Pozzik thinking? He knows that I don't have even half of that stuff!

Teamwork makes the dream work, or so they say. It would appear that the rhyme carries truth to it. Hmmm.

&lt;Eternus pauses for a moment in thought.&gt;

I wonder what other rhymes carry such power. That bears some future experimentation.

I was truly hoping that the gnome I sought out would be the one to answer my call.

&lt;Artificer Morphalius looks you over.&gt;

I suppose you'll do.

Incredible! Did you find any survivors?

&lt;Achelus lowers his voice to a whisper.&gt;

I'll be honest, &lt;name&gt;; nobody else was willing to take on this mission. You are a brave &lt;class&gt;...

&lt;Magistrate Solomon puts on his monocle.&gt;

Oh, you're not Conacher. What have you got there?

&lt;Magistrate Solomon takes Parker's report from you.&gt;

Oh for pity's sake. Yowler? AGAIN?

&lt;Lucille reads the orders.&gt;

So This pirate seeks to destabilize House Waycrest? As if we don't have enough problems already!

Thank you for bringing this to my attention, &lt;class&gt;. It seems that the coven might just be the beginning of Kul Tiras' troubles...

&lt;Clay grumbles to himself.&gt;

Those'll do. Just put them down over there.

&lt;The Earthen looks you up and down with one eye and then spits dust onto the ground.&gt;

I'm going to have something for you to do in a moment. Maybe.

Teamwork makes the dream work, or so they say. It would appear that the rhyme carries truth to it. Hmmm.

&lt;Eternus pauses for a moment in thought.&gt;

I wonder what other rhymes carry such power. That bears some future experimentation.

Teamwork makes the dream work, or so they say. It would appear that the rhyme carries truth to it. Hmmm.

&lt;Eternus pauses for a moment in thought.&gt;

I wonder what other rhymes carry such power. That bears some future experimentation.

Alright... let me see... using the cipher from when the ship went missing...

&lt;Nodd is clearly doing some calculations in his head.&gt;

Aha!

Purchase the Ethereal Bandages from Kifaan.
Ethereal Bandage (1)



