Купи ефірні бинти в Кіфаана.
Ефірний бинт (1)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(274772, 0, 1, null, null));

en:
Awesome!  A dragon of my very own!  Someday I plan to own a real one.

&lt;Salandria slyly eyes her new toy, the gears within her mind turning.&gt;

This has been the best trip ever!  I hope it never ends.

What word do you bring from Highmesa?

&lt;You explain what you know and give the greatmother the bad news concerning Longrunner Bristlehorn.&gt;

My... my grandson!

&lt;The greatmother fights to keep control of her emotions.&gt;

He died an honorable death like a true taunka!

You were the last to be with him, &lt;name&gt;, so he shall always be a part of you. I give you my thanks for completing his last wishes.

&lt;Franklin rambles almost incoherently, explaining the mechanics of mining storm silver from a seam&gt;

... and that is how you... get the most of mining... Zzz...

&lt;As Franklin drifts to sleep amidst a pungent cloud of alcohol vapors, you think of the advice he provided.

Eager to experiment with your new mining technique, you leave the sleeping man laying where he is.&gt;

In all my days of living I would have never expected to see this...

&lt;Father Montoy appears to be salivating.&gt;

Oh yes, you will be rewarded dear $g. You will be greatly rewarded. Give it here. Now!

Gather 8 Luminous Fibers from creatures near Lightbloom Ath'Ran.
8Luminous Fibers (8)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(239067, 0, 8, null, null));

&lt;Clive looks over the lock picks.&gt;

Not bad, not bad.

Listen, me friend, you've done me a great service today. I trust now that you have the design, should I ever need another set, I'll know who to contact.

&lt;Clive gives you a sly wink of his eye.&gt;

ua:
&lt;Клайв оглядає відмички.&gt;

Непогано, зовсім непогано.

Слухай, друже, сьогодні ти $p(зробив:зробила) мені велику послугу. Тепер, коли ескіз у тебе, я знатиму, до кого звернутися, якщо колись знадобиться ще один набір.

&lt;Клайв змовницьки підморгує тобі.&gt;

en:
&lt;Tiffany examines your work.&gt;

I see. I would have ground this facet's angle differently... but your work is passable.

Why don't I write down my design for you. That way, you can try to be more like me.

ua:
&lt;Тіффані оглядає твою роботу.&gt;

Зрозуміло. Я б зробила кут цієї грані інакше... але твоя робота цілком прийнятна.

Запишу тобі свій ескіз. Так ти зможеш спробувати стати більше схожим на мене.

en:
This will make a fine meal for the men.

&lt;The chef leans in closer to whisper in your ear.&gt;

Here, boy, take some for yourself. You look like you could use some more meat on your bones!

You're the best daddy ever!

&lt;Millie gives you a big hug around the knees.&gt;

Here, I made you some lemonade. I only have enough for one glass, so don't drink it too fast!

That wasn't so hard now was it, peaches?

&lt;Estelle holds the coins you brought up the the light and practically purrs.&gt;

Yes yes, these are so very strange...

ua:
Не так уже й важко було, правда, персику?

&lt;Естель піднімає принесені тобою монети до світла й буквально мурчить від задоволення.&gt;

Так, так, вони справді дуже дивні...

en:
Obtain clues from Twilight's Blade cultists in the Ruins of Deatholme.
10Twilight Clues (10)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(266893, 0, 10, null, null));

Collect 6 missives.
6Twilight's Blade Missive (6)



