6Послання Клинка Сутінків (6)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(244844, 0, 6, null, null));

en:
Pff!  You're late!  Do you know how long I've been waiting for Ner'gosh to deliver this orb?

&lt;Xi'lun looks down at the orb, then up at you.&gt;

There's something strange about this orb... it's too...

&lt;Xi'lun trails off.&gt;

Never mind, it must be my nerves talking.  Thank you for the delivery.  For blood and honor!

Collect 6 Stolen Seeds.
6Stolen Seeds (6)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(242226, 0, 6, null, null));

