en:
&lt;Ve'nari examines the writ.&gt;

Quite an interesting way to record one's secrets. This may prove a challenge to decipher.

Thank you for bringing this to me.

You claim to have heard the ghosts whisper to you? And they mentioned Teron Gorefiend?

&lt;Zorus shudders.&gt;

Yes... I know Teron Gorefiend. Rather, I knew of him. He has long been thought dead. What could these ghosts be speaking of?

&lt;Captain Vimes smiles slightly as you relate the events you witnessed at the Hyal family grave.&gt;

It's good to know that they understand. You didn't tell them about James, did you?

I'll deliver his wife's message to him, but I doubt he'll understand.

&lt;Azik looks you up and down.&gt;

Azik is betting you are someone of importance to your people.

Come closer, friend. Azik could use your help.

&lt;Dirge spits out some leather sandal bits.&gt;

Pfftooey...

&lt;Dirge hacks loudly.&gt;

What? I'll have you know that leather is surprisingly high in protein and low in carbohydrates.

&lt;Roark scans the horizon.&gt;

Yes, here. A good natural bay. The remains of that old warship can be gutted and turned into your first transport.

I see you've gathered all the materials we need. Are you ready?

ua:
&lt;Роарк оглядає горизонт.&gt;

Так, тут. Гарна природна бухта. Залишки того старого бойового корабля можна розібрати й перетворити на твій перший транспорт.

Бачу, ти $p(зібрав:зібрала) усі потрібні матеріали. $p(Готовий:Готова)?

en:
Death and acts of sacrilege pervert this land.

&lt;Lantinga lets out a drawn-out sigh.&gt;

Thankfully, we're here to stop it.

Good work.  One moment please...

&lt;The draenei takes a moment to compare your sample with a sample he presumably had distilled earlier.&gt;

Yes, this appears to be the same corruption that is affecting the wildlife.  With this knowledge, and with your combat expertise, we may have the power to stop this.

ua:
Гарна робота. Хвилинку, будь ласка...

&lt;Дреней порівнює твій зразок із тим, що, схоже, дистилював раніше.&gt;

Так, схоже, це та сама скверна, що вражає живу природу. З цим знанням і твоєю бойовою майстерністю ми, можливо, зможемо це зупинити.

