en:
&lt;Farseer Corhuk stares at the ground, lost in contemplation. He nods his head affirmatively.&gt;

&lt;Farseer Corhuk wipes a tear away.&gt;

The son is the father... May the spirits have mercy on those that stand in his way.

Keb'ezil is relieved that you've taken care of that little problem, aren't you, Keb?

&lt;The imp ignores its master, presumably out of indignation.&gt;

You'll have to forgive his bad manners. You know how demons can be...

The chieftain's spirit told you to bring this to me?

&lt;Xarantaur examines the totem.&gt;

Ah, I see what he intended. By telling you to use this totem to close the rifts in the deep, he has given us a clue as to what's happening to the timeline. A wise chieftain, this Swiftspear, watching over his people even in death.

&lt;Johnny is sobbing loudly.&gt;

Tw... Twinkles!!!! Th... It killed her!

&lt;Johnny continues to cry. Little snot bubbles form in his nostrils.&gt;

&lt;You do a doubletake when the Pandaren suddenly speaks with Connelly's voice.&gt;

'Bout time, laddie! I've been waitin' fer ya to show up.

These Pandaren are good people but can't mix a martini fer nothin'.

&lt;Jarod gazes at the ring for a long minute before closing his hands around it. He puts the ring in a pocket.&gt;

This is Maiev's ring. She would never part with it.

She must be at Black Rook Hold!

ua:
&lt;Джерод довго дивиться на перстень, перш ніж стиснути його в руках. Він кладе перстень до кишені.&gt;

Це перстень Майєв. Вона б ніколи з ним не розлучилася.

Вона має бути у Фортеці Чорного Грака!

en:
&lt;Raggaran appears to have calmed down a bit since your last encounter.&gt;

Good, good.  One step closer to eliminating those beady-eyed, basket-wearing, hog-nosed, two-toed...

&lt;Raggaran's anger is clearly rising again.&gt;

...hunchbacked, squealing, prickly... no-good... gnome-loving... GREEEAAAAGH!  Quilboar!

&lt;Jazz dusts himself off, looking exhausted.&gt;

Ya wouldn't believe how many times that's happened today--that was the biggest one yet, too.

Hope you're ready to get your hands dirty, &lt;name&gt;. We've got work to do!

Gather the Relics of High King Anasterian Sunstrider.
 Stay awhile and listen (1)
Crown of the High King (1)
Anasterian's Book of Law (1)



