WH.ge('icon-list-icon2').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(251899, 0, 1, null, null));

ua:
Збери реліквії верховного короля Анастеріана Сонстрайдера.
 Зупинись на мить і послухай (1)
Корона верховного короля (1)
Книга законів Анастеріана (1)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(251904, 0, 1, null, null));
WH.ge('icon-list-icon2').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(251899, 0, 1, null, null));

en:
&lt;Therazane's eyes appear slightly more crystalline than you recall.&gt;

Ozruk has been reclaimed by the earth.

Take your reward and leave me be, &lt;name&gt;.  I wish to be left alone.

Collect 100 Sparks of War in Eversong Woods, while in War Mode.
100Spark of War (100)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(219934, 0, 100, null, null));

ua:
Збери 100 Іскор війни в Лісі Вічноспіву, перебуваючи в режимі війни.
100Іскра війни (100)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(219934, 0, 100, null, null));

en:
&lt;Boog takes the letter from you and begins to examine it.&gt;

Interesting.

&lt;Boog smells the parchment.&gt;

Hrm... Troubling...

&lt;Boog folds the paper in half and looks at you.&gt;

Can't understand a damn thing written here - if that is writing. Could just be toilet paper. Sure smells like it.

&lt;You drop the fetishes into the pot.&gt;

Yes... yesss...

My spirit is strong again, &lt;race&gt;, and I am ready to return to the world.  Now I need a body.

&lt;Sef looks at you, distressed and heartbroken.&gt;

I'm... We could try again, but... I think this is a sign... You seem more than capable of defending those who need it. Maybe it's time for me to move on. 

&lt;Sef's frown turns into a half smile.&gt;

I'm eternally grateful for what you did. I may not have a body, but because of you, I don't need one anymore.

Before I go, let me show you how I made my enchanting rod.

A recipe, a personal letter.... a grocery list? Oh! Yeah, this is a coded communication. Hmmm

&lt;Kelsey rubs her chin and idly flips one of her knives as she thinks&gt;

I'm betting whoever is in charge here has the cipher. Why don't you go pay them a visit and get it for us.

ua:
Рецепт, особистий лист... список покупок? О! Так, це закодоване повідомлення. Хм...

&lt;Келсі потирає підборіддя і задумливо крутить один зі своїх ножів.&gt;

Б'юся об заклад, той, хто тут головний, має шифр. Може, навідаєшся до нього й добудеш його для нас?

en:
&lt;You tell Nalthanis of your time with the cursed elves and the enchantments you learned.&gt;

That's fascinating! You managed, through enchantments, to create a bond with those elves and now they may come to your aid?

Those are some truly powerful enchantments you were gifted, &lt;name&gt;. Don't let them go to waste.

&lt;An amused voice enters your mind.&gt;

Ah, the trickster Jani thought to amuse himself at my expense. I suppose that is the payment I have earned for stepping on his tail.

Thank you. This shrine will once again serve the Zandalari.

ua:
&lt;У твоїй свідомості лунає веселий голос.&gt;

Ах, ошуканець Джані вирішив розважитися за мій рахунок. Що ж, мабуть, це розплата за те, що я наступила йому на хвіст.

Дякую тобі. Це святилище знову служитиме зандаларам.

