en:
Teamwork makes the dream work, or so they say. It would appear that the rhyme carries truth to it. Hmmm.

&lt;Eternus pauses for a moment in thought.&gt;

I wonder what other rhymes carry such power. That bears some future experimentation.

Helix is the one responsible for the gnoll attacks?

&lt;Kearnen nods at the tower.&gt;

He's inside. He's been there for days. I've just been waiting for an excuse to bust him.

ua:
Це Гелікс стоїть за нападами гнолів?

&lt;Кірнен киває на вежу.&gt;

Він усередині. Сидить там уже кілька днів. Я просто чекала на привід його схопити.

en:
It seems that the loss of their lieutenant has only stirred the nest. They are more angry and aggressive than before!

&lt;Waltor sighs.&gt;

You've done what you can here, friend. At the very least you deserve some form of compensation for thinning their numbers.

Excellent!

&lt;A fierce grin creeps onto Ricket's face.&gt;

Let the destruction begin!

&lt;You describe the results of your scrying.&gt;

Commander Sarannis, you say? Hmm...

She's one of Kael'thas's advisors, but certainly not a mage. I remember her from the attack on Kirin'Var Village. I think your impressions are correct, &lt;name&gt;. She's not maintaining the curse personally, but she holds the key to it.

ua:
&lt;Ти розповідаєш про результати свого магічного спостереження.&gt;

Командувачка Саранніс, кажеш? Хм...

Вона одна з радників Кель'таса, але точно не маг. Пам'ятаю її з нападу на Селище Кірін'Вар. Гадаю, твої враження слушні, &lt;name&gt;. Вона не підтримує прокляття особисто, але тримає ключ до нього.

