en:
&lt;Qadarin watches Thiernax race off. He sighs before turning to you.&gt;

My apologies. Thiernax may have seemed curt, but there is a reason for his reluctance to speak of the Night Warrior.

If you have a moment to help me out in the garden, I can elaborate. Then I will see what can be done to convince Thiernax to help your mother.

&lt;Clarissa claps excitedly.&gt;

Mr. D you're gonna be ok! Hooray!

&lt;Clarissa expertly places all of the parts you collected into Large Daddy.&gt;

Oh, Mr. D! I knew it!

Collect Withered Roots and Critter Meat for the village.
 Speak to the Hungry Villager (1)
