en:
Aha! This will be much simpler than I'd first thought.

&lt;Lyndras takes a moment to jot some instructions down on a scrap of vellum.&gt;

Here, &lt;name&gt;. You should have it.

I am indeed familiar with items such as this.

&lt;Stefan looks you in the eye.&gt;

It would seem, &lt;name&gt;, that you have been... chosen.

ua:
Мені справді знайомі такі речі.

&lt;Стефан дивиться тобі в очі.&gt;

Здається, &lt;name&gt;, тебе... обрали.

